#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0312 expect=skipped domain=ADLBC
#note "No scope key. PARAMCD makes the dataset BASIC DATA STRUCTURE, whose structure set does not contain OCCURRENCE DATA STRUCTURE, so the Data_Structures gate rejects it before the subclass gate is reached. Data would fire if the rule ran. Pairs with the ADMH fixture to isolate the two gates from each other."
#library standard=adamig version=1-1
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col PARAMCD  type=Char
col SMQ01NAM type=Char
col SMQ01SC  type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | SYSBP | CARDIACDISORDERS | WIDE
